<#9c3cc8>STRONGEST REJECTION</>
AT Field		^X
  A barrier in front of him: nothing hits him while it
  is up and it pushes attackers away. Drops when he attacks.
AT Field (while blocking)		^X (guard)
  Costs 30% of the barrier gauge on top.
Barrier gauge
  The bar under his screws. Hits on the barrier drain it,
  and it refills while the barrier is down. If it breaks
  he is stunned for about a second.
It's All Fiction (revive)
  Once per match, at 0 life with 2 bars: he gets back up
  with 15% life.

<#9c3cc8>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves
  him open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, knocks them away. 75 second
  cooldown.
Dash / Back Hop		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash		_F_F (air)
Double Jump		_U (air)
Fast Fall		_D^Y (air)

<#9c3cc8>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C (air)
  Light chains into heavier, standing into crouching.

